      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Max approaches Victoria at the bar. She pours him a strong drink to say thank you. We'll hear it in Russian first; don't worry about catching every word. Let's listen closely to the conversation in Russian first, and then walk through each line together.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
